* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# Fork-owned on first touch: when BOTH the template and this repo changed one of
# these files, the merge keeps THIS repo's version whole-file (driver configured
# by sync-updates-from-template.yml / the manual recipe). Untouched files keep receiving
# template updates. Forks: add your own lines to claim more files.
README.md   merge=ours
SECURITY.md merge=ours

# Fork-owned extension zone (docs/UPDATING.md): a fork's own scripts, tests, and
# workflows. The template ships nothing into these paths beyond the hello-world
# example, so a conflict is only possible if a fork names a file exactly as the
# template later does - merge=ours then keeps the fork's version whole-file.
custom/**                      merge=ours
.github/workflows/custom-*.yml merge=ours
